m"},{"id":"84a742ac-8e44-4fae-aa48-b7db9b70563f","createdAt":1786942191510,"transform":{"position":[34,0.16713403461306142,137],"rotation":[0,1.1361261116456518,0],"scale":[1,1,1]},"kind":"preset-prop","prop":"activity-board","options":{"number":1,"title":"March a gladiator round the arena","target":"Click a gladiator in the arena → Program.","steps":[{"cat":"control","text":"repeat 4 times","depth":0},{"cat":"motion","text":"move forward 30 feet","depth":1},{"cat":"control","text":"wait 1 seconds","depth":1},{"cat":"motion","text":"rotate 90 degrees","depth":1},{"cat":"control","text":"wait 0.5 seconds","depth":1}],"tip":"Four sides, four right turns — 360 divided by 4 is 90, so he ends up exactly where he began. Try five sides: what angle do you need? Then swap move forward for glide 30 feet over 3 seconds and watch the difference between jumping and travelling.","accent":"#a8834a"}},{"id":"ee750962-b273-4fa6-867c-18eb387b706d","createdAt":1786942191511,"transform":{"position":[74,0.4538040066594049,122],"rotation":[0,-0.4048917862850834,0],"scale":[1,1,1]},"kind":"preset-prop","prop":"activity-board","options":{"number":2,"title":"Two gladiators, one signal","target":"Click the gladiator by the arch → Program. Then click one in the arena.","steps":[{"cat":"look","text":"say ready","depth":0},{"cat":"control","text":"wait 2 seconds","depth":0},{"cat":"look","text":"say fight","depth":0},{"cat":"control","text":"when an object says fight","depth":0},{"cat":"motion","text":"move forward 14 feet","depth":1},{"cat":"look","text":"change color to red","depth":1}],"tip":"The first three blocks go on ONE gladiator. The when-an-object-says block goes on the OTHER one — it sits and waits until it hears the word. This is how you make two objects work together instead of each doing its own thing.","accent":"#8c7a56"}},{"id":"efdd7793-2fe5-440a-9bf3-9e354db6498d","createdAt":1786942191512,"transform":{"position":[0,26,0],"rotation":[0,0,0],"scale":[1,1,1]},"kind":"light-orb","color":"#f2a541"},{"id":"560d4cd1-a6ed-4693-b2c3-7de1961d2d63","createdAt":1786942191514,"transform":{"position":[118,16.074834496597816,62],"rotation":[0,0,0],"scale":[1,1,1]},"kind":"light-orb","color":"#f2a541"},{"id":"e8433d4a-cce6-4f4e-aa31-d1bc8441de43","createdAt":1786942191515,"transform":{"position":[-30,8.999999999999993,60],"rotation":[0,0,0],"scale":[1,1,1]},"kind":"light-orb","color":"#f5f5f5"}]}